OL,3,GNEWSA'Floating tractors' clean up
OL,4,Aweed-choked waterways
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fleet of weed harvesters are helping
OL,7,Fto clean up the waterways in north-west
OL,8,FEngland.
OL,10,FThe Canal & River Trust is spending
OL,11,Fmore than #150,000 to use machines
OL,12,Fcalled Truxors to remove aquatic weeds
OL,13,Flike duckweed, floating pennywort and
OL,14,Fazolla, which when left unchecked can
OL,15,Fcause problems for boats.
OL,17,FThe weeds can also starve underwater
OL,18,Fplants of light and reduce levels of
OL,19,Foxygen needed by fish and other
OL,20,Fwildlife, and can have a damaging
OL,21,Fimpact on kingfishers and otters.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
