OL,3,GNEWSA'Floating tractors' clean up
OL,4,Aweed-choked waterways
OL,5,
OL,6,FKieran Howlett, from the Canal & River
OL,7,FTrust, said managing the weeds was
OL,8,Fbecoming more challenging but the
OL,9,Fcharity was determined to protect the
OL,10,F"wonderful waterways".
